use repetition without boredom is the holy grail of vocabulary learning. A daily five-minute puzzle delivers exactly that: spelling practice, common letter combinations, and word recall, wrapped in a game you genuinely want to open. Wordbaazi’s answers come from a curated list of two thousand common English words — words worth knowing, not obscure dictionary filler — which makes it a natural fit for students, for anyone polishing their professional English, and for families playing together over dinner."}],"$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8"],"$L9","$La"]}]]}],["$Lb"],"$Lc"]}],{},null,false,null]},null,false,"$d"]},null,false,null],"$Le",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$f",["$L10"]],"S":true,"h":null,"r":"$undefined","s":"$undefined","a":"$undefined","l":"$undefined","p":"$undefined","d":"$undefined","b":"LCa-BidybHM1Rqmy90HO8"}
